  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "After a Fedora relase, fcrepo4-vagrant is then tied to the SNAPSHOT version. However those artifacts are generally not recreated during the development cycle. Therefore there is no difference between the release and the post-release artifacts.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Therefore it makes sense that fcrepo4-vagrant should only be updated at a release of Fedora and left there until the next release.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Tagging ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "557058:fe14f014-ccfb-4882-b081-85802f8c5346",
        "text": "@Nick Ruest"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": " for thoughts?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
